d black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]ci-signal-restore[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]ci-signal-restore: stop cancelling in-flight master runs, skip CI on the[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]release-please branch, disable matrix fail-fast, add the missing beads [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]sidecar to the lint environment, pin keep-sorted, and file beads for the[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]two observed flaky tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Build the Rust core once per run[/bold #D7AFFF]                              [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]core-wheel-once[dim] · [dim][/dim]after ci-signal-restore[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]core-wheel-once: add a build-core root job that builds one abi3 [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]sase_core_rs wheel per run, teach the Justfile a SASE_CORE_WHEEL install[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]path, fan the wheel out via artifact and a setup-sase composite action, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and drop the duplicated sase-core rust-check from bead-backend.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Consolidate lanes without losing coverage[/bold #D7AFFF]                     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]lane-consolidation[dim] · [dim][/dim]after core-wheel-once[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]lane-consolidation: merge the three perf-floor jobs into one, delete the[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]redundant install-smoke/bead-backend/build/fmt-md-check jobs after [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]folding their unique steps into neighbors, run the visual suite exactly [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]once per run, build docs once per event, and serialize docs deploys.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Derive the CI sidecar environment from configuration[/bold #D7AFFF]          [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]con